│ interventions with or without psychological components improve symptoms of depression and anxiety in COPD. Cognitive │
│ behavioral therapy is also an effective intervention for managing depression in COPD, but treatment effects are      │
│ small. Cognitive behavioral therapy could potentially lead to greater benefits in depression and anxiety in people   │
│ with COPD if embedded in multidisciplinary collaborative care frameworks, but this hypothesis has not yet been       │
