Review: Psychological therapies for the treatment of anxiety disorders in chronic obstructive pulmonary disease
Total studies to screen: 18

SELECTION CRITERIA:
We considered all randomised controlled trials (RCTs), cluster‐randomised trials and cross‐over trials of psychological 
